  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ultrasound Training Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Konbit Sante will implement an ultrasound training project aimed at improving ultrasound diagnostic imaging capacity at select health centers in northern Haiti. Diagnostic tests allow clinicians to develop effective treatment plans by confirming the absence or presence of a disease or health condition. Diagnostics are either unavailable or underutilized in Haiti due to a lack of sufficiently trained staff. An estimated 15,000 patients each year will benefit from expanded imaging capacity.</narrative>
  </description>
